# 💕 Do You Love Me?

A playful and interactive love-question website created as a fun way to ask
someone special, "Do you love me?" ❤️

The website uses cute messages, playful responses, and interactive moments
to create a fun romantic experience. It is designed to make a simple love
question more memorable, personal, and entertaining.

## ✨ Features

- 💕 Interactive "Do you love me?" experience
- 🤗 Playful and cute responses
- 😭 Funny reactions when the answer is delayed
- 🍫 Sweet and romantic messages
- 😘 Personalized final love message
- 💬 Multiple stages of interactive messages
- 🎭 Fun emotional reactions
- ✨ Simple and engaging interface
- 📱 Mobile-friendly responsive design
- 💻 Works on desktop and mobile devices
- 🎨 Easy-to-customize messages
- ❤️ Can be personalized for anyone

## 🎯 About The Project

This project is a fun interactive way to ask someone a simple but special
question:

> "Do you love me?" ❤️

Instead of asking directly through a normal message, the website creates a
playful conversation-like experience.

The person visiting the website is presented with cute and funny messages,
encouraging them to think again before giving their answer.

The experience can include messages such as:

- "Do you love me babu? 🤗"
- "Think again sweet girl 🍫"
- "Itni jaldi na matt bolo 🤗"
- "Babu man jao na! Kitna bhav khaogi 😭"
- "I knew it! You Love me 😘"

The messages can be changed to match your own personality, relationship,
language, and style.

## 💝 Personalization

You can easily customize the website for your special person.

Change:

- 💌 Main question
- 💬 Interactive messages
- 😭 Funny reactions
- 🍫 Sweet messages
- ❤️ Final message
- 👤 Names or nicknames
- 📝 Hindi, English, or Hinglish text
- 🎨 Colors and visual styling
- ✨ Animations and effects

This makes it possible to create your own unique version of the experience.

## 🎮 How It Works

The website follows a simple interactive flow:

```text
Start
  ↓
"Do you love me?" ❤️
  ↓
User interacts
  ↓
Cute / playful response
  ↓
Another chance to answer
  ↓
More funny & romantic messages
  ↓
"I knew it! You Love me 😘"
